1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,932
ZAMIN FK muxlislari endi bir-biriga qarshi o‘ynaydi.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,266
Bitta klub emas — to‘rtta.

3
00:00:06,286 --> 00:00:08,006
Hammasi sizdan tug‘iladi.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,333
Klub nomini siz yozasiz.

5
00:00:10,353 --> 00:00:12,813
Eng ko‘p layk olgan nom klubga aylanadi.

6
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:15,233
Yozgan odam esa uning asoschisi.

7
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:16,532
To‘rt klub.

8
00:00:16,552 --> 00:00:17,532
Uch o‘yin.

9
00:00:17,552 --> 00:00:18,752
Bitta g‘olib.

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,760
Izohga klub nomini yozing.

11
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,160
Yigirma to‘rt soat.

12
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:27,380
Eng ko‘p layk olgan to‘rtta nom — to‘rtta klub!

